  "title": "frame: Try to prevent a clobbering warning",
  "description": "Under some unknown conditions GCC optimizes itself just right into a\nclobbering warning in the frame dissector on certain versions of GCC\nand Qt and in MRs that don't actually touch packet-frame. Mark a\nvariable as volatile to try to fix that.\n\nThis is only needed directly on 4.4 because of the changes in\n5d3605b293038c9c28ee3c83829ed393aabaf901",
